Project Design Phase

The Project Design Phase is the stage where we plan how the project will be built based on the requirements.

Main Points:

Design System Structure – Decide how different parts of the project will work together.
Design User Interface – Create the layout of pages, buttons, menus, and screens.
Design Database – Decide how user information and project data will be stored.
Choose Technologies – Select suitable programming languages, frameworks, and tools.
Create Prototype – Prepare a basic model or prototype before actual development.
